1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:09,330
Comparing numbers with equal number of digits

2
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:26,110
If two numbers have the same number of digits and each pair of digits in the same place are identical, then the two numbers are equal.

3
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:41,330
Compare two numbers 6852 and number 6852

4
00:00:41,860 --> 00:01:01,310
Because these two numbers have the same number of digits and each pair of digits in thousands, hundreds, tens, ones places are identical

5
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:16,080
We have result: 6852 equals 6852

